{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "98bb781a090462cb007b2d10ea8af9ae503afb6b15e41119cd68655ed1f6413e", "ja": "悪役を演じるということ", "zh": "关于饰演反派角色这回事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8eff74ad96fa40e8f2d65a0f67085f271a3a00196cb5eb5f37ec716a7486f858", "ja": "公開本読みから数日後。ロコはハードな作品\nに気疲れしてしまっていた。一方、悪役で\nある自分の役が好きになれず悩む星梨花は\n翼やロコ、プロデューサーとの会話を経て、\n自分の役に前向きになる。", "zh": "公开读本会数日后。ROCO因这部艰苦的作品而感到身心疲惫。另一方面，喜欢不上自己所饰演的反派角色而烦恼的星梨花，在与翼、ROCO以及制作人的交谈后，开始积极面对自己的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e3381c8becadf1aae658b7f1d0c42ededb1f4a1d5d35050c17409d6673f73eaa", "ja": "本読みから数日後、稽古休みの日……", "zh": "读剧本几天后，排练休息日……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "ebe4aec8188b9f836e1c6884190d28e648d64747e8e7aac21977fdf7227a8f82", "ja": "はぁ～……。", "zh": "唉～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "35f6aad889b743414be6a150b31663ab6cee33d6437b6f01da811e98e91ee7a3", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　ロコ。\nそんなに大きなため息を吐いて……。", "zh": "怎么了？ROCO。\n居然叹了这么大一口气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "3d8ec7e968969985d2719ded93d1b473f222a737b04a3b16c2adf6b1411bb2e4", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……えへへ。\n実はロコ、ちょっぴりナーバスになってまして……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……嘿嘿。\n其实ROCO，我有点紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "25a75759b24c0d3372e03ac7bb9daeb85742a9565fdfecabaf991630d310c491", "ja": "ロコは今までにも、何度か演技のお仕事をさせて\nもらっていたから。すこしだけ自信があったの。", "zh": "因为ROCO之前也有过几次演戏的工作经历，  \n所以我还是稍微有点自信的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9b4aa80dde98eca8e8e03be7c8aa1f973099557ee7d1d169afb81d03e9765043", "ja": "そうだな。今までの経験が、カナエの演技にも\n活かされているように見えたよ。", "zh": "是啊，你之前积累的经验，似乎也运用到了加奈惠的演技中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "b6943f92d2918d141ea730d4d161ee16adfda485d97b42a495f3b720b8628d73", "ja": "でも今回の撮影は、ハードなシーンが多くて……\nメンタルがベリーハードで、タイアードなんです～。", "zh": "不过这次拍摄里，艰苦的场景太多了……精神状态已经超困难，而且还很疲惫～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "240d82515e40241b75f01b30abb6e3e15bd5d2a5c4f39e670569cc39b8e607bb", "ja": "仲間のレイカやアユムとも、気を抜けない関係ですし。\nずっと緊張しっぱなしで、苦しいです……。", "zh": "和同伴丽花、步之间也是不能有丝毫松懈的关系。一直紧绷着神经，真的很难受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1008_p", "source_sha256": "986aad9992876bd8816dba51ca7af683b53e282a24fe7763fa22e9ed3c966390", "ja": "なるほど。確かに、これまでロコがやってきた\n演技とのギャップは、大きいかもしれないな……。", "zh": "原来如此。确实，和ROCO至今为止的演技相比，反差可能确实不小……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "e88afb7b7cac1323be56ebadee3c85d02259270ecece16c91423af4c6c4accfa", "ja": "はい……。でも大変さで言ったら、ヴィランの\nセリカやツバサのほうが、よりハードかも……。", "zh": "是的……不过要说辛苦程度，饰演反派的星梨花和翼或许更难一些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "6f68ac7f7f751b74962563c43f248400bd33eb9f080dba11e4b3b947e84c7ccd", "ja": "殺伐とした雰囲気は、ロコたち以上に、\nヴィランであるふたりのほうが多いわけですし。", "zh": "毕竟，要说杀气腾腾的氛围，作为反派的两个人比ROCO他们更强烈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1011_p", "source_sha256": "af80d9c150a384e3b34c31c27f8b4a9f0d4a8bea317d01cd8a2eb72a70978b81", "ja": "確かにな。そうか……だからふたりも、\n読み合わせをしてるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "确实如此。原来如此……所以那两个人，\n也许也是在对台词吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "83499c9e51262398c806e396b0f34721e1f8fb52650ecdfb9a91a130e2616c7a", "ja": "え？　読み合わせって……。", "zh": "咦？对戏是指……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3e4ce9164835e97038b449f1dc081a53ce91a1d9f22c313358e0af526bb8a53b", "ja": "星梨花と翼も、劇場に来てるんだ。\n会議室にいるはずだよ。", "zh": "星梨花和翼也来剧场了。\n应该在会议室里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9ac610ab9aab9c5287f1567d3346b5716617c3a523dee94c8cec17ade7ee07b7", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れ様。\nすこし休憩しないか？", "zh": "两位都辛苦了。要不要稍微休息一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d10b2413d7bf3e5683fc69e16ddc9ef477059d224fd29eca31d2387ba59c4449", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nロコちゃんも、お疲れさまでーす！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\nROCO也辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "3009354f670663516510347f05153d631a6f029ff5a865d73f825b3352ca9d36", "ja": "お疲れさまです。\nふぅ……。", "zh": "辛苦了。\n呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "787e078cb4de709cda103bc44825000ddd18602e8e996d57c517a32e32919127", "ja": "？　セリカ……\nもしかして、タイアードですか？", "zh": "？星梨花……难道说，你很累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "3a8257fc4280f75a51a1955cac5adf1157d20a095738578475e5adb6905db8bc", "ja": "疲れてるなら、糖分がマストですよ！\n{$P$}がお菓子をくれたのでどうぞ♪", "zh": "如果累了，糖分是必需品哦！\n{$P$}给了我点心，请用吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b87b227f73d4207790a2286fbe5fc5d70cadc7ba57386657b9d51e2512052db", "ja": "わーい、おやつだ！　いただきま～す♪", "zh": "哇—，有点心！我开动啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "0831f28b96d7fc1168a4111f61da88262bbd6ee3cf202180ce83b775e08e75f2", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ロコさん、\nありがとうございます。", "zh": "{$P$}先生、ROCO先生，\n谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a911e0579d640ce8a52bf81ac1c4734ef984926f5204a125dac0eb2312c6c4a1", "ja": "それで、星梨花。\n疲れて見えるのは、もしかして……。", "zh": "所以，星梨花。\n你看起来好像很累，难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "bb3e46d7f4c1e0450672b14898265c675057ddf8652f899442d8a848c023fef9", "ja": "はい……わたしなりに、鞠音のことを考えて、\nお芝居をしているつもりなんですけど……。", "zh": "是的……我也在设身处地地想着鞠音，努力演好这出戏，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1fdd33d76b35e82e53f354c9c9e3f5c196e4db7dc0a906a3f928adaed0d4472c", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、鞠音のこと好きになれないんだって。", "zh": "星梨花她，说自己没办法喜欢上鞠音。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "57a8a34d037f84c6627b669911ca2960c89322a859659fbf952536497bae76a0", "ja": "好きになれない、ですか？", "zh": "喜欢不上……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "b210dca73ff2d33822dbc8480bb2b56bcdc119bb0470e1924f1be58eb40c3e99", "ja": "はい。鞠音は大富豪で、このゲームを主催してる……\nお話の中でも、とっても大事な役割の人ですよね。", "zh": "是的。鞠音是大富豪，也是主办这场游戏的人……\n在故事中，她是扮演着非常重要角色的人，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "b2518040eaa4fcbd2ce25eac8339f09e0857a69207dd7a20c9f45113159ad1ff", "ja": "ゲームの参加者さんたちに、何度も怖いゲームを\n仕掛けたり、怯えさせるようなことを言ったり……。", "zh": "对游戏的参加者们反复设下恐怖的游戏，\n还说些吓人的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "ae12defff6dc18757167ca2ce973258361877b0ed9229a86aa9ccfe8f8138a3a", "ja": "そういう面ばかりじゃないのはわかってるんですけど、\nどうしてもイヤな人にしか思えなくて……。", "zh": "我知道那并不是他的全部，可我还是怎么都觉得他是个讨厌的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "82d77820fb3855191b930d4a9d4ad0fe5deeabd2991d84ef6c3899a74b328c9b", "ja": "役に共感できない部分があって、辛いという感じか……\n同じ主催側だけど、翼はどうだ？", "zh": "是因为对角色有无法产生共鸣的部分，所以觉得难受吗……\n同样作为主办方，翼觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5b97ca2d44feeab4c3c387c56879831041f0c9318617048c46eb551115518a11", "ja": "わたしは、あんまり気にならないかも……？\nだってお芝居だし、そういうお話っていうか……。", "zh": "我好像不太在意……？\n毕竟是演戏嘛，应该说，这是那样的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dcd62dd83fe5b97d61fe9135b5e907eb68ea2dab658c4e86dbfaf9879d4e20ed", "ja": "ゲームを引っかき回す役だから、ちゃんとやらないと、\n逆にカッコ悪く見えちゃう気がするんですよね～。", "zh": "因为是负责把剧情搅得天翻地覆的角色，所以不好好演的话，反而会显得很逊，我觉得～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "e0a3c70a12c1060910da42ee33d8865445cb01d279ead57d8d944496cffce9c9", "ja": "そうだな……そこは翼の言うとおりだと思う。\n思いきってやれないと、作品として成り立たないし……", "zh": "是啊……我也觉得，那里就像翼说的那样。\n如果不能放手去做，作品也就无法成立了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1032_p", "source_sha256": "9594c0baefff6f9336c69799e90127ee29e56332036b148aceb9b148ed72c40b", "ja": "星梨花のファンの人達は、今回の作品で星梨花の\n新たな一面が見られることを期待していると思うんだ。", "zh": "我觉得，星梨花的粉丝们应该都很期待通过这次作品看到星梨花全新的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1033_022ser", "source_sha256": "f097c84089449749bf9404e4a53516ddf088d0f4c99ab23812cefc67221ca68f", "ja": "わたしの新たな一面……ですか？\n今回の映画で……？", "zh": "我的另一面……吗？\n在这次电影里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d683054f7ca128bcce4321e8b05666fffba9951d3d25b9fe163548dc77c64da5", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、普段すっごくいい子だもんね。\nだからこそ、悪役をカッコよくできたらすごいのかも？", "zh": "星梨花平时是个特别乖的孩子嘛。所以，要是能把反派演得很帅气，说不定会很厉害呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "33cdf1facfbf77e62249e04260fbbc35d201872fc403cb4da66006dc8940a8b9", "ja": "うん、そうだな。それに星梨花がイヤな役を演じたから\nといって、星梨花本人までイヤな子だとは思わない。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。而且就算星梨花演了讨人厌的角色，\n大家也不会觉得星梨花本人就是个讨厌的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "540557b9cc2a339abce480e1c3e62f89845926f692e367ff781aa56b7a34fb8e", "ja": "というか、そう思う人がいたら、それは\n星梨花のお芝居が、本物に見えたって事だ。", "zh": "或者说，如果有人这么想，那就说明星梨花的演技看起来很真实。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1037_025roc", "source_sha256": "939fbdb10fe5263736cc8cbcdc7ddfbb7c7e145c7cb0b96a3a15d24bac78663d", "ja": "ロコもそう思います！　それはセリカの\nお芝居にリアリティがあったってことだと思います！", "zh": "ROCO也这么觉得！　这就说明，星梨花的演技很有真实感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "2d46e0a5a0a6578501d9ab8397391a91b58c32b0dcd6aeb02421f3e125b185dc", "ja": "星梨花がそれだけ頑張ったという事は、必ず伝わる。\nだから自信を持って、堂々と演じてほしいな。", "zh": "星梨花付出了这么多努力，一定能传达给大家。\n所以，希望你能充满自信，大大方方地去演绎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "b38faccaa7f1cf59a034fff136bd459d8853fb571d0f6faa41a3b2cdb83f5973", "ja": "自信を持って、堂々と……わかりました。\nわたし、もうすこしがんばってみます！", "zh": "充满自信，大大方方地……我明白了。我会再努力一点的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6eff2b2d7cd1738047ac6cf8e428067ae7cf5a8a8bc1a9972a531bddd197abce", "ja": "星梨花ちゃん、キツいなって思ったら言ってね。\n気分転換ならいつでも付き合うし♪", "zh": "星梨花，要是觉得辛苦就告诉我哦。\n想换换心情的话，随时都可以陪你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "320a96c47c65160613764b0093c8d38b2d7cbb9af53023f3816c797ff545a820", "ja": "翼さん、ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃ、読み合わせの続きをお願いできますか？", "zh": "翼姐姐，谢谢你！那么，可以继续帮我对台词吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1043_025roc", "source_sha256": "f6b27943eefe0b67c91fd005d76eda4a8e859578b4f798f07df9d8c302c553b5", "ja": "ロコも参加していいですか？　ふたりから、\nインスピレーションをもらいたいので。", "zh": "ROCO也可以参加吗？因为我想从你们两位那里获得灵感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1044_022ser", "source_sha256": "520c7a0eaedb7e4072fad8da26dd42972e4e7f6544b8efc8eb3d31ce549be991", "ja": "もちろんです！　それじゃあ翼さん、\n54ページのセリフから……お願いします！", "zh": "当然可以！那么翼小姐，就从第54页的台词开始……拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "e7895f09259a9f9c0f972c6acde3a0811721f9911d287509c757c33c082c30c8", "ja": "（ロコも星梨花も、気持ちが切り替わったようだ。\nどの立場でも難しいと思うが、上手くいくといいな）", "zh": "（ROCO和星梨花似乎都转换了心情。无论站在哪种立场上，这都很难做到，希望一切能顺利吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
